{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1b79208ccdb844ceb3575a47bf00c8b452a8a97919fa933fe43352ce27885dcb", "ja": "（ホラー映画『魅裏怨』のDVD売上が好調だ。\n販売元の人が、菓子折りを持ってお礼にきてくれた）", "zh": "（恐怖电影《魅里怨》的DVD销售成绩非常好。\n经销商的人带着点心盒前来致谢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1001_p", "source_sha256": "70b8bc5a393889a57a67dacadede1276bba1aac8f0cc0ebf37d4bd3b3dd17e39", "ja": "和三盆を使ったスイーツ詰め合わせか。いろいろ\nあるんだな。みんなにも配って回らないと。", "zh": "用和三盆制作的甜点礼盒吗？\n有好多种类喔，也要分给大家才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "20ea70b859b47f28302dbb4860c5ad0adb7c9962e3ef6a2a6ef9cece2072b44e", "ja": "さんぼ、わさんぼ、和三盆～♪", "zh": "一盆、两盆、和三盆～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1003_p", "source_sha256": "19850f3d2143ea800da2ab685e78d0f4ea5c72b279c0cb4563842dd4064fe4fd", "ja": "お、噂をすれば……この歌は麗花だな。\nちょうどよかった。", "zh": "哦，说人人到……听这个歌声应该是丽花吧，\n来得正好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1004_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1005_p", "source_sha256": "172dba9606fb1518dcf0b210be6642bf2b78a677dbb700ff02d192298c2d6c6b", "ja": "お疲れさま、麗花！　お菓子をもらったんだけど、\nひとつ……って、あれ？　誰もいない？", "zh": "辛苦了，丽花！刚才我收到点心，一个……\n咦，奇怪？没人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "c56f1a944dbb607183802dc968debb1c131f343960a737ffe3d0ca5794e07c8c", "ja": "『さんぼ、わさんぼ、和三盆～♪』", "zh": "『一盆、两盆、和三盆～♪』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a2fede4ff2a216551acfacc5d62da293496b99fc3f5b91d71689e70a019532ca", "ja": "な、なんだ？　声はするのに、麗花がいない。\nこれはまさか……いや、そんなはずは……。", "zh": "什、什么？明明有声音，却没看到丽花，\n这该不会是……不，怎么可能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "f6db5e8dfc200f8b26ae2d2e5c72f444ed3d7e616e60a28c6fb5b56493780472", "ja": "ぷっぷかさんかもしれないですよ？", "zh": "说不定是噗、噗卡小姐喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1009_p", "source_sha256": "bc9eb18994cd1634276f47e31298a78937c5b61b8536654f5487cbf9caba9c1a", "ja": "うわぁ！！？\n……って、麗花！", "zh": "唔哇！！？\n……呃，丽花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "938c0549f55a939f491133e4c1765ddd9c456dfd088262658c74997d16154a37", "ja": "ふふっ、大成功ですね！　とっても普通の\n驚き方だったので、今日から驚キューサーさんです！", "zh": "呵呵，大成功！你吓到的方式真平凡，\n所以从今天起，你就叫惊吓制作人先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1011_p", "source_sha256": "97ec2c5e85e032d5586e0d60c8abe6dbe0822cfbfbc44c8a9ebda65a09d2939b", "ja": "麗花、どうして後ろに……\n声は確か、部屋の中からしていたはず……？", "zh": "丽花，你怎么会在我身后……\n声音应该是从房间里传来的呀……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "4f1020ccae74da446f96ad782dbf1a40cf97421821f7c17af786fe23155acb84", "ja": "実は最近、部屋が散らかってきたので、\n使わないものを、押入れにポイポイってしてたんです♪", "zh": "其实最近我的房间变得很凌乱，\n所以我把没在用的东西都丢进衣橱里♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "f3d98be307ee1ca45d27598dd21f71d58fb67ec9dcd182ba174e5a3942820505", "ja": "そしたら押入れの奥から、お母さんが昔使ってた\nラジカセを発見して。思わず、録音してみました！", "zh": "结果我在衣橱深处发现妈妈以前使用的录音机，\n忍不住就试录了一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1014_p", "source_sha256": "31702a5f3b928c569709ecf7ce097749e68302f73adeba8c884f119eb471e3f5", "ja": "なるほど……それで、驚かせようと？", "zh": "原来如此……然后你想用来吓人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "4f8259b9b869fa7887fe8ab044544e81df05a2f867402cc304e383d4f265eacc", "ja": "はい。誰もいないところから声が聞こえたら、\n怖いかな？と思って。", "zh": "没错，\n我很好奇在没人的地方听到人声会不会很恐怖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "b903d34affb20c40248b62ee8cad8752ea8ada4187e6e68a9934febcf947a878", "ja": "バッチリだったみたいですね！　これで\n『魅裏怨2』のお話が来ても大丈夫ですよ、えっへん♪", "zh": "看来很完美呢！\n这样就算要拍《魅里怨2》也没问题了，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7a4042eae97c03e16f47b684bdcfa14fe2648482e2f703c61462a9a193960cd4", "ja": "なるほど……だいたい理解したよ。\nとはいえ、本気でビックリするからやめような。", "zh": "原来是这样……我大概了解了。\n话虽如此，这真的会吓到人，别再这样做啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "5e11b99fb3e7264001c467c5a0c3239c58bf6c8c8189dae9b63a53eeeb5612d1", "ja": "あれあれ？　ダメですか？", "zh": "咦咦咦？不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1019_p", "source_sha256": "90ed5eec64c62ac65de202f55da63904d7ce8a753dc09cd5418f5c007759e9ea", "ja": "怖いというより、ビックリしちゃうからな……。\nとにかく、劇場のみんなにはやらないこと。いいな？", "zh": "因为比起恐惧，这比较算是惊吓……\n总之，不可以对剧场的大家这样做喔，知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "469c48f27427ff17158d953441a6c3de730877fa5d3901de714986746aea0303", "ja": "う～ん、そっかぁ。\n『驚く』と『怖がる』の違いって難しいなぁ。", "zh": "唔嗯～这样啊，\n『惊吓』跟『恐惧』的差异好难分喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "22b7d10309bb1c3ad0ffb05d5a794fa06080e5214b4d9614384603b0265c417f", "ja": "でも、わかりました！　じゃあこれからは、みんなが\n驚かない方法で、怖がらせるようにがんばりますね！", "zh": "不过我明白了！\n我今后会努力用不吓人的方式，让大家感到恐惧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "1ed1e131cd81e7fb3c22d473576f27a6fcd7cb27a656e4bd40f54f831c4a618f", "ja": "ところで{$P$}さん、\n私に何か用があったんじゃないですか？", "zh": "话说回来，{$P$}先生，\n你是不是有事要找我呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1023_p", "source_sha256": "b254a764e73a50fdd9051dd454a2c2e80eb6787dc0c76e8113d2a458e522f3df", "ja": "え？　ああ、そうだった。\n驚いたショックで、すっかり忘れていた……。", "zh": "咦？啊，对喔，\n惊吓的冲击让我完全忘记了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1024_p", "source_sha256": "1623c4b129ac194df54a0c5898c8f3f0142b1194c69d38f77af6fda86938f2f4", "ja": "その『魅裏怨』の販売元の人にお菓子をもらったから、\nみんなに配ろうとしてたんだよ。ほら。", "zh": "《魅里怨》的经销商送了点心过来，\n我正打算要发给大家，拿去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "b89803ef4b5a2c3f46915579461d1625b11e038920958a6972120025315f1e16", "ja": "わぁ、和三盆のスイーツ！　おいしそう！\nじゃあ私は、このマカロンを頂きますね♪", "zh": "哇啊，是和三盆的甜点！看起来好好吃！\n那我就收下这个马卡龙啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0133_1026_p", "source_sha256": "b6b1f5ca8d562326395960fa16ff7e5d80efa543bef3daf96a4d101801e1435b", "ja": "（お菓子を食べながら、屈託のない笑顔を見せる\n麗花。相変わらず、計り知れないな……！）", "zh": "（吃着甜点，脸上同时挂着爽朗笑容的丽花，\n还是一样深不可测啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
